@startuml
!include business_symbols.iuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor #315E57
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #7A9892
skinparam LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor transparent
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor transparent
skinparam ParticipantFontColor #173F39
skinparam ActorBorderColor #315E57
skinparam ActorFontColor #173F39
skinparam EntityBorderColor #315E57
skinparam EntityFontColor #173F39
hide footbox

participant "<$business_actor>\n顾客" as Customer
participant "<$business_worker>\n门店员工" as Clerk
participant "<$business_entity>\n租赁与维护管理系统" as System
participant "<$business_actor>\n第三方支付服务" as Pay

Customer -> Clerk : 提出换装或跨店归还申请(合同号、装备)
activate Clerk
Clerk -> System : 查询有效合同与装备状态(合同号、受理门店)
activate System
System -> System : 校验合同、租期、原门店、装备位置与占用状态()
System --> Clerk : 返回合同明细与可办理方式
deactivate System
Clerk -> Clerk : 检查装备并记录归还时间、损坏与安全情况()

alt 选择换装
  Clerk -> System : 查询并锁定替换装备(适配条件、剩余租期)
  activate System
  System -> System : 校验适配、预约冲突、维修与安全状态()
  System -> System : 计算换装差价()
  System --> Clerk : 返回替换装备与费用调整
  deactivate System
else 选择归还
  Clerk -> System : 计算归还费用调整(检查结果、实际归还时间)
  activate System
  System --> Clerk : 返回费用调整类型与金额
  deactivate System
end

opt 需要补款或退款
  Clerk -> System : 建立唯一支付调整请求(合同号、类型、金额)
  activate System
  System -> Pay : 请求补款或退款(请求号、金额)
  activate Pay
  Pay --> System : 返回支付调整结果
  deactivate Pay
  System --> Clerk : 返回支付凭证
  deactivate System
end

Clerk -> System : 确认换装或归还结果(检查结论、支付结果)
activate System
System -> System : 更新合同、装备位置与状态并记录审计轨迹()
System --> Clerk : 返回办理结果与费用明细
deactivate System
Clerk -> Customer : 交付替换装备或电子归还凭证()
activate Customer
Customer --> Clerk : 返回确认
deactivate Customer
deactivate Clerk

@enduml
